<rml>
<head>
	<link type="text/css" href="/ui/theme/theme.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="main">
	<div class="screen scroll">
		<div class="spacer-24"></div>
		<p class="title">洛洛希雅</p>
		<p class="subtitle">登录以同步你的资料与番组表</p>

		<div class="card">
			<div class="field">
				<span class="label">服务器地址</span>
				<input type="text" data-value="baseUrl"/>
			</div>
			<div class="field">
				<span class="label">用户名</span>
				<input type="text" data-value="loginUserName"/>
			</div>
			<div class="field">
				<span class="label">密码</span>
				<input type="password" data-value="loginPassword"/>
			</div>
		</div>

		<p class="error" data-if="loginHasError">{{ loginError }}</p>
		<p class="loading" data-if="loginLoading">正在登录…</p>

		<div data-if="!loginLoading">
			<button class="block" data-event-click="action('login')">登录</button>
			<div class="spacer-8"></div>
			<button class="secondary block" data-event-click="action('save-server')">保存服务器地址</button>
		</div>

		<div class="spacer-24"></div>
		<p class="muted">首次使用请先填写服务端地址；会话保存在本机，过期后会自动回到这里。</p>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
